*   **Calculation:**

    ΔG = 2 * (-237.1 kJ/mol) - 0 kJ/mol - 0 kJ/mol
    ΔG = -474.2 kJ/mol

*   **Given that 2 moles of hydrogen gas react 1 moles of oxygen gas:**

